  "notes": "Only the BioLogic .mpt text exports are read (the same runs also exist as .mpr and processed csv files). Each experiment zip has a real \"Raw Data/Degradation Cycling/\" folder with the actual aging cycles, but only as .mpr (BioLogic binary); \"Raw Data/Performance Checks/\" is the only data also exported as .mpt (text), which is the only format this adapter reads. So scale.n_cycles_total is empty not because the cycling data is missing, but because it only exists in a format not yet parsed - the registry's cycle_summary_done = yes looks correct. Cell spec (LG M50 (21700 NMC)) from LG's INR21700 M50 18.2Wh document, the same source used for dataset_27."
